  description: 'From strategy to content production, from influencer campaigns to private domain CRM. Everything you need, under one roof.',
  cta: 'Explore our services',
  ctaReady: 'Ready to grow in China?',
  ctaReadySub: 'One call. We\'ll walk you through what fits your brand.',
